  "query_preview": "/TUESDAY THROUGH THURSDAY/...\nIssued at 1257 AM CDT Fri Jul 24 2026\n\nAn upper level ridge will remain in place across the central\nCONUS, with warmer, above normal temperatures continuing through\nthe end of the forecast period. However, cold front passage late\nMonday night into Tuesday will lower temperatures slightly,\nkeeping criteria below any heat headlines at this time, with\nhighs expected to be in the low to mid 90s. There will also be a\ncouple of disturbances that move through the High Plains region\nTuesday through Thursday, bringing a chance of isolated\nthunderstorm chances each day.",
